<title>HONG KONG: Arvind Mills sets US$100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Arvind Mills sets US$100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Union Bank of Switzerland's Hong Kong branch.</p>
<p> BORROWER    ARVIND MILLS LTD</p>
<p> AMOUNT	US$100 MLN  COUPON     L+130BP  MATURITY  7 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	  FRN	   ISS PRICE  PAR	LAUNCHED  22.MAY.97</p>
<p> PUTS	  NONE	  CALLS	NONE     REPLIES   05.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING     NONE	  REPAYMENT  BULLET   DENOMS    $100K</p>
<p> RATING	--	    SALE LMTS  STANDARD TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG     YES	   CRS DEF    YES	FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY   INDIA	 GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> PAY DATE    18.JUN.97 (TENTATIVE)</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGERS	 US$10 MLN   50BP  ALL-IN  137.14</p>
<p> CO-LEAD MGRS	  US$5 MLN    40BP  ALL-IN  135.71</p>
<p> CO-MANAGERS	   US$2-3 MLN  25BP  ALL-IN  133.57</p>
<p> ARRANGER   UNION BANK OF SWITZERLAND'S HONG KONG BRANCH</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6371</p>
</text>
